%% Diagram 1: System Context Diagram (C4 Level 1) — OopsieEats
flowchart TB
    subgraph Users ["AKTOR PENGGUNA"]
        RegularUser["👤 Regular User\n(Pengguna Mobile Pelacak Gizi)"]
        AdminUser["🛡️ Administrator\n(Pengelola Master Data & CMS)"]
    end

    subgraph SystemBoundary ["BATAS SISTEM OOPSIEEATS"]
        OopsieApp["📱 OopsieEats Mobile Application\n• Flutter 3.x / Dart ^3.13.4\n• On-Device YOLO26n TFLite (9.4 MB)\n• Mifflin-St Jeor & Atwater Engine\n• Neo-Brutalism UI & Complete Profile Guard"]
    end

    subgraph CloudServices ["LAYANAN CLOUD EKSTERNAL"]
        subgraph FirebaseCloud ["Google Firebase (asia-southeast2)"]
            FirebaseAuth["🔐 Firebase Authentication\n(Email/Password, Google OAuth 2.0)"]
            FirestoreDB["🔥 Cloud Firestore\n(Multi-Tenant NoSQL Database)"]
        end

        subgraph SupabaseCloud ["Supabase Platform (ap-southeast-1)"]
            SupaStorage["☁️ Supabase Storage\n(Private Bucket 'food-history-images' via RLS)"]
        end
    end

    subgraph DeviceHardware ["PERANGKAT KERAS PERANGKAT"]
        DeviceCamera["📷 Kamera & Galeri Foto"]
        DeviceBio["🔒 Sensor Biometrik (Fingerprint / Face ID)"]
        DeviceKeyStore["🗝️ Hardware KeyStore / Keychain"]
    end

    RegularUser -->|Input porsi, foto makanan, kelola profil| OopsieApp
    AdminUser -->|Kelola pangan master, verifikasi Atwater, audit log| OopsieApp

    OopsieApp -->|Ambil foto hidangan| DeviceCamera
    OopsieApp -->|Verifikasi biometrik| DeviceBio
    OopsieApp -->|Enkripsi sesi lokal AES-256| DeviceKeyStore

    OopsieApp -->|Pertukaran token sesi JWT & Google Sign-In| FirebaseAuth
    OopsieApp -->|Kueri & sinkronisasi data reaktif via gRPC TLS 1.3| FirestoreDB
    OopsieApp -->|Unggah foto kompresi & ambil signed URL| SupaStorage

